# 23. Reverse Mode
The framework can run backward.
Observe organizational behavior first.
Example:
"Information moves quickly inside departments but poorly between them."
Infer:
`strong intragrain behavior + weak grain-boundary transfer`
Then search materials science for known solutions to analogous interface problems.
This creates:
`organizational symptom
-> physical analogue
-> candidate mechanisms
-> redesigned organization`
